# T-1154: n@[is: guard] no longer binds n (n is Pattern::Pin — wildcard, no binding).
# Use [case [let n] n body] to bind n, then inline the guard check in the body.
# n has type Unknown in CaseArm (scrutinee_ty is always Unknown for CaseArm).
# No UnificationFailure warning: Unknown is compatible with 0 (gradual typing).
[match -5
  [case [let n] n [if [> n 0] "positive" "other"]]]
=== out
String("other")
